      "method": "Loaded the original prices/universe/calendar with load_dataset; read the already frozen factor CSV with text symbols and parsed dates; reran run_backtest(..., score_column=None) in memory with cost_multiplier 0,1,2. Read the corresponding frozen daily_multifactor[_cost0/_cost2].csv and recomputed metrics from daily returns. Relative wealth = (1+strategy total)/(1+same-cost benchmark total)-1. All commissions, slippage and sell-tax rates scale together. No original data, configs, outputs or repository files were modified. Values are the full precision outputs of that in-memory audit run.",
